## VM settings for one local node that another application starts and owns.
## Use them with RELEASE_VM_ARGS=<release>/sidecar.vm.args and
## RELEASE_MODE=interactive, which loads modules on first use instead of all at
## boot. They replace releases/<version>/vm.args.

# Two schedulers bound the threads and per-scheduler memory the VM allocates.
+S 2:2
+SDcpu 1:1
+SDio 2

# Idle schedulers go to sleep at once instead of spinning first.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
